name simplivre
category Package
revision 64280
shortdesc Write your books in a simple and clear way
longdesc This package provides a LaTeX class for typesetting books with
longdesc a simple and clear design. Currently, it has native support for
longdesc Chinese (simplified and traditional), English, French, German,
longdesc Italian, Japanese, Portuguese (European and Brazilian), Russian
longdesc and Spanish typesetting. It compiles with either XeLaTeX or
longdesc LuaLaTeX. This is part of the minimalist class series and
longdesc depends on minimalist.sty from the minimalist package. The
longdesc package name "simplivre" is taken from the French words
longdesc "simple" and "livre" (= "book").
depend minimalist
